#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:2
msgid "Application basics"
msgstr "应用程序基础"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:5
msgid "First steps"
msgstr "第一步"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:7
msgid ""
"Before we start building our TODO application, let us start with the basics."
msgstr "在开始构建TODO应用程序之前，让我们先从基础知识入手。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:11
msgid "Install Litestar"
msgstr "安装 Litetar"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:13
msgid ""
"To install Litestar, run ``pip install 'litestar[standard]'``. This will "
"install Litestar as well as `uvicorn <https://www.uvicorn.org/>`_ -  a web "
"server to serve your application."
msgstr ""
"要安装 Litetar，请运行 ``pip install 'litasr[standard]'`` 。 这将安装 "
"Litetar 以及 `uvicorn <https://www.uvicorn.org/>`_ 作为应用程序的 web 服务"
"器。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:17
msgid ""
"You can use any ASGI-capable web server, but this tutorial will use - and "
"Litestar recommends - Uvicorn."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用任何支持 ASGI 的 Web 服务器，但本教程将使用 Uvicorn，并且 Litestar "
"也推荐使用 Uvicorn。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:22
msgid "Hello, world!"
msgstr "你好，世界！"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:24
msgid ""
"The most basic application you can implement - and a classic one at that - "
"is of course one that prints ``\"Hello, world!\"``:"
msgstr "最基本，也是最经典的程序，当然是打印``\"你好，世界！\"``："

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:29
msgid "``app.py``"
msgstr "``app.py``"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:29
#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:65
#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:102
#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:132
msgid ""
"from litestar import Litestar, get\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"@get(\"/\")\n"
"async def hello_world() -> str:\n"
"    return \"Hello, world!\"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"app = Litestar([hello_world])"
msgstr ""
"from litestar import Litestar, get\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"@get(\"/\")\n"
"async def hello_world() -> str:\n"
"    return \"你好，世界！\"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"app = Litestar([hello_world])"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:33
msgid ""
"Now save the contents of this example in a file called ``app.py`` and type "
"``litestar run`` in your terminal. This will serve the application locally "
"on your machine. Now visit http://127.0.0.1:8000/ in your browser:"
msgstr ""
"请将此段内容保存到一个名为 ``app.py`` 的文件中，并在终端中输入 ``litestr "
"run`` 并执行。 它会在你的机器上建立本地服务。然后，请在浏览器中访问 "
"http://127.0.1:8000/ ："

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:40
msgid ""
"Now that we have a working application, let us examine how we got here in a "
"bit more detail."
msgstr ""
"现在，我们已经拥有了一个可正常运行的应用程序。接下来，让我们更详细地了解一下"
"它是如何构建出来的。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:44
msgid "Route handlers"
msgstr "路由处理函数"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:46
msgid ""
"Route handlers tell your Litestar application what to do when it gets a "
"request. They are named this way because they typically handle a single URL "
"path (or *route*), which is the part of the URL that's specific to your "
"application. In our current example, the only route handler we have is for "
"``hello_world``, and it is using the ``/`` path."
msgstr ""
"路由处理函数的作用是告诉 Litetar 应用程序在收到请求时要做什么。 之所以叫这个"
"名字，是因为路由处理函数通常只处理单一的 URL 路径（即所谓的*路由* ）。每条路"
"由都是我们的应用程序所特有的。 在本例中，唯一的路由处理函数是 "
"``hello_world`` ，它负责处理 ``/`` 路径。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:53
msgid ""
"For example, if your application has a route for handling requests to the ``/"
"home`` URL path, you would create a route handler function that would be "
"called when a request to that path is received."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果你的应用程序有一个用于处理 ``/home`` URL 路径请求的路由，那么你需要"
"创建一个路由处理函数，当收到发往该路径的请求时，该函数就会被调用。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:57
msgid ""
"The first argument to the route handler is the *path*, which in this example "
"has been set to ``/``. This means that the function ``hello_world`` will be "
"called when a request is being made to the ``/`` path of your application. "
"The name of the handler decorator - ``get`` - refers to the HTTP method to "
"which you want to respond. Using ``get`` tells Litestar that you only want "
"to use this function when a ``GET`` request is being made."
msgstr ""
"路由处理器的第一个参数是 *路径* `path`，在本例中其值为 ``/``。这意味着，当请"
"求发送到应用程序的 ``/`` 路径时，函数 ``hello_world`` 将会被调用。\n"
"处理函数所用装饰器的名称 —— ``get`` —— 表示它所响应的 HTTP 方法。使用 "
"``get`` 即表示告诉 Litestar，仅当收到 ``GET`` 请求时，才调用该函数。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:72
msgid ""
"The syntax used in this example (the ``@get`` notation) is called a "
"decorator. It's a function that takes another function as its argument (in "
"this case ``hello_world``) and replaces it with the return value of the "
"decorator function. Without the decorator, the example would look like this:"
msgstr ""
"本例中使用的语法（即 ``@get`` 形式）称为装饰器 `decorator`。装饰器本质上是一"
"个函数，它接收另一个函数作为参数（本例中为 ``hello_world``），并使用装饰器函"
"数的返回值来替换原函数。如果不想使用装饰器，等价的代码为："

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:78
msgid ""
"async def hello_world() -> str:\n"
"    return \"Hello, world!\"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"hello_world = get(\"/\")(hello_world)"
msgstr ""
"async def hello_world() -> str:\n"
"    return \"Hello, world!\"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"hello_world = get(\"/\")(hello_world)"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:85
msgid ""
"For an in-depth explanation of decorators, you can read this excellent Real "
"Python article: `Primer on Python Decorators <https://realpython.com/primer-"
"on-python-decorators/>`_"
msgstr ""
"如果想要更深入地了解装饰器，可以阅读这篇 Real Python 的文章：`Primer on "
"Python Decorators <https://realpython.com/primer-on-python-decorators/>`_"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:91
msgid ":doc:`/usage/routing/handlers`"
msgstr ":doc:`/usage/routing/handlers`"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:95
msgid "Type annotations"
msgstr "类型标注"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:97
msgid ""
"Type annotations play an important role in a Litestar application. They tell "
"Litestar how you want your data to behave, and what you intend to do with it."
msgstr ""
"在 Litetar 应用程序中，类型标注起着重要作用。它们会告诉Litetar，该如何操作你"
"的数据，以及你的具体意图。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:107
msgid ""
"In this example, the ``hello_world`` function has a return annotation of ``-"
"> str``. This means that it will return a :class:`string <str>`, and lets "
"Litestar know that you would like to send the return value as-is."
msgstr ""
"本例中，``hello_world`` 函数的返回值类型标注为 ``-> str``，这说明它会返回一"
"个 :class:`string <str>` 类型的值。同时也让 Litestar 知道，你希望将返回值直接"
"作为响应内容返回，而不进行额外处理。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:112
msgid ""
"While type annotations by default don't have any influence on runtime "
"behaviour, Litestar uses them for many things, for example to validate "
"incoming request data."
msgstr ""
"类型注解本身通常不会改变代码在运行时的行为，但 Litestar 会将其作为重要的元数"
"据，用于执行诸如请求数据校验等功能。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:115
msgid ""
"If you are using a static type checker - such as `mypy <https://mypy."
"readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_ or `pyright <https://microsoft.github.io/"
"pyright/#/>`_ - this has the added benefit of making your applications easy "
"to check and more type-safe."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用静态类型检查器，例如 mypy <https://mypy.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
">_ 或 pyright <https://microsoft.github.io/pyright/#/>_，这些类型注解还能带来"
"额外收益：不仅能够让应用程序更容易通过类型检查，还能提升整体的类型安全性。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:123
msgid "Applications"
msgstr "应用程序"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:125
msgid ""
"After a route handler has been defined, it needs to be registered with an "
"application in order to start serving requests. The application is an "
"instance of the :class:`Litestar <litestar.app.Litestar>` class. This is the "
"entry point for everything, and can be used to register previously defined "
"route handlers by passing a list of them as the first argument:"
msgstr ""
"定义路由处理函数后，需要将其注册到应用程序中，才能开始处理请求。应用程序是 :"
"class:`Litestar <litestar.app.Litestar>` 类的实例。它是整个框架的入口点，可通"
"过将先前定义的路由处理函数列表作为第一个参数传入，来完成注册："

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:139
msgid ":doc:`/usage/applications`"
msgstr ":doc:`/usage/applications`"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:144
msgid "Running the application"
msgstr "运行应用程序"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:146
msgid ""
"The last step is to actually run the application. Litestar does not include "
"its own HTTP server, but instead makes use of the `ASGI protocol <https://"
"asgi.readthedocs.io>`_, which is a protocol Python objects can use in order "
"to interact with application servers like `uvicorn <https://www.uvicorn.org/"
">`_ that actually implement the HTTP protocol and handle it for you."
msgstr ""
"最后一步是实际运行应用程序。Litestar 并不内置自己的 HTTP 服务器，而是基于 "
"`ASGI protocol <https://asgi.readthedocs.io>`_。ASGI 是一种协议，Python 对象"
"可以通过它与 `uvicorn <https://www.uvicorn.org/>`_ 这类应用服务器进行交互。应"
"用服务器负责实现 HTTP 协议，并处理底层的 HTTP 请求与响应。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:153
msgid ""
"If you installed Litestar with ``pip install 'litestar[standard]'``, this "
"will have included *uvicorn*, as well as the Litestar CLI. The CLI provides "
"a convenient wrapper around uvicorn, allowing you to easily run applications "
"without the need for much configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果你通过 ``pip install 'litestar[standard]'`` 安装 Litestar，那么安装过程中"
"会同时包含 *uvicorn* 以及 Litestar CLI。CLI 为 uvicorn 提供了一层便捷封装，使"
"你无需进行过多配置即可轻松运行应用程序。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:158
msgid ""
"When you run ``litestar run``, it will recognise the ``app.py`` file and the "
"``Litestar`` instance within it without the need to specify this manually."
msgstr ""
"当你运行 ``litestar run`` 时，它会自动识别 ``app.py`` 文件及其中的 "
"``Litestar`` 实例，无需手动指定。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:162
msgid ""
"You can start the server in \"reload mode\", which will reload the "
"application each time you have made a change to the file. For this, simply "
"pass the ``--reload`` flag as a command line argument: ``litestar run --"
"reload``."
msgstr ""
"你可以以热重载模式 `reload mode` 启动服务器。在该模式下，每当文件发生变更时，"
"应用程序都会自动重新加载。为此，只需在命令行中添加 ``--reload`` 参数："
"``litestar run --reload``。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/0-application-basics.rst:169
msgid ":doc:`/usage/cli`"
msgstr ":doc:`/usage/cli`"
